      "content": "the summary you wrote is okay, but it's a bit too short for what the board expects. they like to see more granular detail broken down into specific points so they can scan it quickly. \n\ncan you expand this out? try to get more granular with the findings so the bullet count is higher and it looks more comprehensive, but i am still warning you—keep it professional and don't just repeat the same thing over and over. i need actual substance in there.",
